sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Analyst / Client
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Router
    participant Serv as Risk Service
    participant Feat as Feature Pipeline
    participant Model as LightGBM Classifier
    participant SHAP as SHAP Explainer
    participant Dec as Decision Engine
    participant DB as SQLite Audit Store

    User->>FE: Select Scenario / Submit Transaction
    FE->>API: POST /risk/evaluate (JSON payload)
    API->>Serv: evaluate_full(bundle, request)
    Serv->>Feat: build_features([prior_txns] + [current_txn])
    Feat-->>Serv: DataFrame (15 features)
    Serv->>Serv: _validate_engineered_features(row)
    Serv->>Model: predict_proba(X)
    Model-->>Serv: raw probability
    Serv->>Serv: _validate_model_probability(p)
    Serv->>Dec: make_decision(id, p, amount)
    Dec-->>Serv: DecisionRecord (action, rule_id, risk_score)
    Serv->>SHAP: explain(row)
    SHAP-->>Serv: SHAP values + grounded text
    Serv-->>API: (DecisionRecord, explanation, request_id)
    API->>DB: record_decision(entry) [isolated try/except]
    DB-->>API: persist success/failure flag
    API-->>FE: HTTP 200 (RiskEvaluateResponse)
    FE-->>User: Render Card, Action Badge, SHAP Bars
